DECLUTTER  (add these when the panel is too busy to read)
  --no-ratsnest    drop the airwires -- the biggest source of visual noise on a dense board
  --no-labels      drop ref designators (keep them on crops, drop them board-wide)
  --no-ghosts --no-arrows   drop the --before overlay when you want the CURRENT state alone
  --ratsnest-nets '<glob>'  show ONE bus instead of all of them
  --per-side / --flat       split or merge the two sides
  --ignore-nets <plane nets>  a plane-routed rail's airwire is a fiction; excluding it is what makes crossings/hpwl reproduce the optimizer's own numbers
